    "title": "Worth a Hundred Soldiers",
    "text": "PRINT AVAILABLE\n\nYoooo sorry I haven't updated here in awhile, I keep forgetting! Anyway, I got really really into Attack on Titan recently I know I am quite late but yeah GODDAMN!!! I hardly ever watch anime nowadays but this one captured my attention, I was so impressed with the animation and the tense storyline - I see why everyone has been talking about it! If you haven't seen it I highly recommend it, you can watch it for free on Crunchyroll!\n\nHere's a little painting of Mikasa Ackerman, one of my favorite characters, if not my favorite one. Her unflappable attitude, her protectiveness and fierceness and badassery make me WEEP WITH JOY!!! Reference from this cap!\n\nReblog on Tumblr: alicexz.tumblr.com/post/655701…\n\nI ran out of episodes so I guess it's on to the manga now, I can't resist...\n\nArtwork by Alice X. Zhang\nwww.alicexz.com — INSTAGRAM | FACEBOOK | TWITTER | SOCIETY6",
